.Dd August 20, 2026
.Dt WORDPROCESS 5
.Os WordProcess 1.0
.
.Sh NAME
.Nm wordprocess
.Nd WordProcess native document-set format and content model
.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A WordProcess
.Pa .wp
file is a compressed binary document set.
It contains one or more ordered, uniquely named documents plus set-level
settings, clipboard data, and add-on state.
Native format 8 is written by WordProcess 1.0.
The file is not a text interchange format and must not be edited manually.
.
.Sh DOCUMENT MODEL
Each document is an ordered sequence of paragraphs.
Each paragraph has one structural style and contains words with embedded
character-style transitions.
Bold, italic, and underline may overlap.
A cursor and optional mark identify the active position and selection.
.
.Sh PARAGRAPH STYLES
.Bl -tag -width PRE
.It Sy P
Plain body text.
.It Sy H1 Ns (en Ns Sy H4
Heading levels one through four.
.It Sy Q
Indented text or long quotation.
.It Sy N
Footnote or endnote.
.It Sy C
Figure or table caption.
.It Sy LB
Bulleted list item.
.It Sy LN
Numbered list item.
.It Sy L
Unmarked list item.
.It Sy V
Run-together indented text.
.It Sy PRE
Preformatted text.
.It Sy RAW
Raw target-language output for supporting exporters.
.El
.
.Sh PAGE LAYOUT
Every document stores page width and height, four margins, body and special font
sizes, body and special line spacing, and long-quote indent.
Built-in starting profiles are Custom, ABNT, and Book.
Editing any preset value marks the layout Custom.
.
.Sh PERSISTENCE
Native saves first write
.Pa file.wp.new ,
then replace
.Pa file.wp .
Compatibility loaders upgrade older formats 1 through 7.
A format mismatch or malformed stream is reported instead of being treated as
plain text.
.
.Sh IMPORT AND EXPORT
Native import and export operate on the complete set.
Interactive import of another format adds one named document.
Interactive non-native export writes the current document only.
Supported import formats are text, Markdown, HTML, and OpenDocument Text.
Export additionally supports Org, LaTeX, and troff.
Lossless round trips are guaranteed only for the native format.
.
.Sh SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS
.Sy RAW
paragraphs can bypass target escaping in supporting exporters and should hold
only trusted content.
Native files and startup scripts should likewise be obtained from trusted
sources.
.
